ind":"announcement","title":"STEAM NEXT FEST IS LIVE!","summary":"Next fest is now live!!!Go play the latest update of the DEADBOOT demo, and let us know what you think. Leave us a review here on Steam or on our Discord.The full game launches November 5th.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:11:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691630","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1846651706687542","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"1 more day until Next Fest!","summary":"Steam Next Fest starts tomorrow, and the new DEADBOOT demo will be in it! We've been polishing the demo and making a ton of improvements since it released. Weapon Augmentations & Weapon RarityRevamped Upgrade-selectionIncreased difficulty & chaos of challenge-roomsAdded Support for Haptics for controller usersNew Music tracks New HazardsBeefier sound engine and sound designIf you haven't played DEADBOOT yet, Next Fest is the perfect time to jump in!The full game launches November 5th, 2026.Play ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T17:20:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687542","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1846018067942034","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"DEADBOOT @ STEAM NEXT FEST!","summary":"In just one week, on October 19th, the new and improved DEADBOOT demo will be taking part in Steam Next fest.We've been putting a ton of work into the demo, and it's feeling better than ever. In the past couple of months, we've added:Weapon Augmentations & Weapon RarityRevamped Upgrade-selectionIncreased the difficulty & chaos of challenge-roomsAdded Support for Haptics for controller users..Alongside many, many small fixes and tweaks based on your feedback and suggestions! If you've played the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:51:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1844115010493189","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"BIG NEWS: DEADBOOT RELEASE DATE + BOOMSTOCK!","summary":"We've got some BIG news to share!DEADBOOT is coming to Steam on NOVEMBER 5TH!After months of hard work, we are now only 7 weeks away from finally putting the full game in your hands. We can't wait to see you blast, kick, and tear your way through the NOVA Headquarters. We still have time to add more crazy shit, so if you want to share your ideas with us, hop on our Discord.BOOMSTOCK 2026 — LIVE RIGHT NOWWe're super happy to be featured in Boomstock 2026, which you can check it out right now! It'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T20:13:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493189","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1839676055888749","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"DEADBOOT will be translated!","summary":"We're working with a localization team to bring DEADBOOT to as many langauages as we can! Currently on the list is: German Spanish (Latin America)Portuguese (Brazil)RussianKoreanChineseJapanesePolishIf you happen to be a native speaker of any of these languages, and you spot something that seems off, let us know on our discord. We're constantly adding things to the game, so at points there may be temporary translations that our localization team hasn't had time to address quite yet. And if there","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T16:21:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888749","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1838407329257258","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"Secret Sauce 2026 Showcase!!","summary":"Hey there! In just a bit, Offbrand is kicking off Secret Sauce 2026 with a bunch of new trailers and announcements from indies around the world. And we're featured in it with a brand new announcement!Make sure to tune in!!!- Deadboot team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T16:45:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1819386365102710","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"Calling all Playtesters!","summary":"Over the holidays we'll be running our first playtest, and sign-ups are now live!! If you've been curious about the game, or want to help us make it as good as it can be, now is the time to get your feedback and ideas heard. The playtest will be a small but polished snippet of the full game, with a limited selection of: EnemiesWeaponsLevelsUpgradesWe need all the feedback we can get to help us make the game as good as it can be, and we're super excited to share what we've been working on! We wan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-22T20:00:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365102710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1814309641445898","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"The Levels of DEADBOOT","summary":"DEADBOOT will have you dying a lot, and it's important that each new run feels fresh and interesting. So in the last month we've been working on expanding our combat arenas and environments, and adding new tech to keep things interesting, and keep you thinking on your feet! LEVELS ARE RANDOMLY GENERATEDLevel layouts are dynamically generated, including enemy spawns, item placements, room-connections, and more. DYNAMIC ENVIRONMENTSInside each room, hazards, covers and layouts swap out on the fly,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-23T16:37:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641445898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1808601382577665","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"It's been two weeks since DEADBOOT was announced. What's next?","summary":"First off, thank you for the wonderful reception. The amount of people who wishlisted and reached out with kind words were way beyond our expectations! What we've shown so far is just the beginning! We're now hard at work on testing and implementing a bunch of new features to deepen the gameplay further. Challenging arenas that lock down when entered, beefier enemies, persistent upgrades, new weapons. The list goes on! As development continues, we would love to get your input on what you would l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-25T14:30:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808601382577665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3819020-1807332909573801","game_id":"steam-3819020","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing DEADBOOT!!!!","summary":"After working on this secret project for the past 6 months, we're super happy to finally announce our indie-game debut!! What is it? DEADBOOT is a roguelite retro FPS with an emphasis on great-feeling and adrenaline-inducing gameplay. See how far you can make it through this gauntlet of violent neon and gore, and hone your skills each run! Discovering new enemies, rooms and upgrades each time. Who are we? Thinking frog are two passionate game-devs with a collective 15 years of experience in AA/A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-07T15:08:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909573801","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3819020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3819020":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3819020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z"},"4667930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:34Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3819020","app_id":3819020,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"65d0ea997daea69be47330fa0015146a64eb80cdde8371c5b42a6b130fa6c9a0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short